		(descr "ESP32-S3 dev board (Amazon ASIN B0F5QCK6X5), two separate 1x22 P2.54mm socket rows. Row spacing 25.4mm, pad 2.0mm / drill 1.1mm -- deliberately loosened from the measured 25.5-26.0mm row spacing for assembly tolerance, per user request. Pin assignment per Espressif ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 J1/J3 tables; J1-origin pins on the +Y row, J3-origin on the -Y row (orientation corrected from initial build). Only the 13 actually-wired signals are named; remaining 31 positions are unconnected pads (NC_*) for mechanical fit of the socket strips.")
